'''Executive officer'''<ref name="LOP" /> (shortened to '''XO'''),<ref name="Catalyst">''[[Catalyst: A Rogue One Novel]]''</ref> also known as '''First Officer''',<ref name="FirstOfficerCard">{{Topps|set=2025 Topps Chrome Star Wars|cardname=First Officer Jensen Corbyt|link=https://www.ebay.com/itm/357539881400|archivedate=20250904014544}}</ref> which also saw a capitalization of '''first officer''',<ref name="Thrawn">[[Thrawn (novel)|''Thrawn'']]</ref> was a [[Assignment|position]] that signified an individual as the second-in-command of a [[starship]].<ref name="FirstOfficerCard" /> It existed within the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Imperial Navy]],<ref name="LOP" /> the [[Chiss Ascendancy]],<ref name="Chaos Rising">''[[Thrawn Ascendancy: Chaos Rising]]''</ref> the [[New Republic]],<ref name="Part One" /> the [[Resistance]],<ref name="LOP" /> and the [[First Order]].<ref name="Attack on Starkiller Base" /> When a [[starship]]'s [[captain]] was busy, it was the task of the First Officer to take over the [[Bridge (starship)|bridge]].<ref name="FirstOfficerCard" />

==History==
===Tagge Corporation===
The position was used in the [[Tagge Corporation]], where it was held by [[Lady]] [[Domina Tagge]], the head of the company.<ref name="Aphra 28" /> 

===Galactic Empire===
[[Nymos Lyle]] served as the executive [[officer]] to [[Admiral]] [[Rae Sloane]] on board the [[Imperial-class Star Destroyer|''Imperial''-class Star Destroyer]] [[Vigilance (Imperial-class)|''Vigilance'']] during the [[Battle of Endor]].<ref name="LOP" />

===New Republic===
[[Lieutenant]] [[Jensen Corbyt]] served as the executive officer to [[Captain]] [[Hayle]] on board a [[Defender-class cruiser|''Defender''-class cruiser]], the ''[[Vesper]]''.<ref name="Part One" /> [[Vic Hawkins]] was executive officer to [[General]] [[Hera Syndulla]] aboard ''[[Home One]]''.<ref name="Part Three">{{Ahsoka|Part Three: Time to Fly}}</ref>

===Resistance===
During the [[First Order-Resistance War]], [[Captain]] [[Idrosen Gawat]] served as [[Admiral]] [[Gial Ackbar]]'s executive aboard the [[Raddus (MC85 Star Cruiser)|''Raddus'']].<ref name="TLJ VD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> He was [[death|killed]] along with most of the [[Resistance High Command]] during the [[Battle of Oetchi]].<ref name="Episode VIII">{{Film|VIII}}</ref>

